	(text "J3 = baseboard J11 (2x19 1.27 mm socket on B.Cu, pin n = baseboard pin n, see MECHANICAL.md).\nEvery signal pin has a 10 k pull-down so the power board sees low while the FPGA is unconfigured\nand the translators are disabled (MIGRATION_PLAN.md 3.2)."
